Browser client — per-host game server URL
-----------------------------------------

The WebAssembly build does not embed a world address. Each site that serves
/play/ chooses the default API URL for that instance:

  1. Query string (highest priority):  /play/?server=https://world.example
     or a same-origin path:            /play/?server=/

  2. window.ISHTARIA_SERVER_URL from ishtaria-config.js (this host's default)

  3. Otherwise the player's saved address, then http://127.0.0.1:7400

Edit /etc/ishtaria/client-web-config.js (conffile), for example:

  window.ISHTARIA_SERVER_URL = "https://world.example";
  window.ISHTARIA_SERVER_URL = "/";       # API on the same origin as /play/

Point the web server at that file as /play/ishtaria-config.js (see the
ishtaria-web Apache/nginx site examples). After changing the file, reload the
web server; browsers may cache the old script briefly.

Desktop builds use the environment variable of the same name instead:

  ISHTARIA_SERVER_URL=https://world.example ishtaria-client
